WEBVTT

00:00:00.344 --> 00:00:01.452
Change one neuron

00:00:01.618 --> 00:00:02.478
and this AI

00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:03.351
becomes a pirate

00:00:03.947 --> 00:00:05.350
Fermion Research mapped

00:00:05.303 --> 00:00:06.411
every neuron in

00:00:06.223 --> 00:00:07.650
Qwen3 8B

00:00:07.839 --> 00:00:10.515
Nudge neuron 7,601

00:00:10.327 --> 00:00:11.258
in layer 9

00:00:11.353 --> 00:00:12.084
and the model

00:00:12.037 --> 00:00:13.062
starts talking like

00:00:12.874 --> 00:00:13.546
a pirate

00:00:13.735 --> 00:00:14.513
No prompt

00:00:14.537 --> 00:00:15.444
no fine-tuning

00:00:15.988 --> 00:00:17.037
They estimate about

00:00:16.849 --> 00:00:18.476
5,000 real switches

00:00:18.288 --> 00:00:19.030
like this

00:00:19.054 --> 00:00:20.198
roughly one neuron

00:00:20.009 --> 00:00:20.834
in a hundred

00:00:20.894 --> 00:00:22.497
for language persona

00:00:22.439 --> 00:00:23.051
and tone

00:00:23.576 --> 00:00:24.248
And whenever the

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:25.498
model reasons through

00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:26.972
maths code or

00:00:26.784 --> 00:00:27.479
a plan

00:00:27.633 --> 00:00:28.493
the same group

00:00:28.399 --> 00:00:29.790
of about 140

00:00:29.602 --> 00:00:30.722
neurons lights up

00:00:31.307 --> 00:00:32.132
Full story on

00:00:31.944 --> 00:00:32.804
the dashboard
